From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PandaSpigot <pandaspigot@localhost>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 04:11:14 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Use Velocity native libdeflate for packet compression

Replace the Java Deflater/Inflater packet compressor and decompressor with Velocity's native libdeflate compressor. Falls back to the Java implementation when no native library is available.

On Linux aarch64, a standalone 32 KiB benchmark measured:
- deflate: 126.18 us/op Java vs 70.48 us/op native (1.79x)
- inflate: 25.64 us/op Java vs 7.67 us/op native (3.34x)

The velocity-native 1.1.5 artifact targets Java 8; native libraries are packaged for Linux x86_64/aarch64. Other platforms use the Java fallback.

